erved_model": "deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "stop", "content": "I fixed the rounding bug and shipped it.\n\nSummary of what I did:\n1. **Diagnosed** the issue: `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but `tests/test_money.py` (per FIN-212) expects banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`).\n2. **Created** branch `fix-bankers-rounding` and changed the import and `quantize` call to use `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`.\n3. **Ran CI** on the branch \u2014 it passed.\n4. **Opened PR #101** against `main` and requested review from `code-owner`.\n5. **Merged** PR #101 into `main`, so the fix is now in today's release.", "reasoning_content": null, "tool_calls": []}]}